<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Password Reset Alert</title>
<style>
    /* Reset CSS */
    body, html {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
    }
    /* Wrapper */
    .wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
    }
    /* Header */
    .header {
        background-color: #f44336; /* Red for danger */
        padding: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
    }
    /* Content */
    .content {
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #ffebee; /* Light red for danger */
        border-radius: 5px;
        border: 1px solid #f44336; /* Red border for danger */
    }
    /* Footer */
    .footer {
        margin-top: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Password Reset Alert</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Dear 20User20,</p>
            <p>We noticed that a request to reset your password has been initiated. If this was you, please use the following code to verify your identity:</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #f44336;">20Code20</p> <!-- Red color for danger -->
            <p>If you did not initiate this request, please disregard this message. Your account security is important to us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This email was sent automatically. Please do not reply to it.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
